                <head>Election of President Zayas<anchor n="1" xml:id="ch44-f1"/></head>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p rendition="#flush">Arrival of General Enoch H. Crowder in Cuba—Supplemental
                        Partial Elections of March 15 and 26, 1921; Decision by the Liberal Party
                        not to Participate—Statement by the United States Government Accepting the
                        Results of the Partial Elections—Drafting of a Program of Administration by
                        President Zayas—Invitation to General Menocal to Call at the Department When
                        Passing through the United States after His Retirement</p></quote>










































